{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120438","id":3897101937,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oSQ5x","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120438","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120438.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120438.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120438","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120438/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120438/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120438/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2b664cfc6d87b5a604d046f8357096c667b02f61","number":120438,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(mono): show C# [Tool] export XML <summary> as Inspector tooltips","user":{"login":"Hirek193","id":23196899,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk2ODk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23196899?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193","html_url":"https://github.com/Hirek193","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hirek193/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8269\r\n\r\nThis PR allows C# `[Tool]` and `[Export]` fields and properties to be described with XML documentation and be exposed in godot inspector as descriptions for custom fields for nodes. After this change, godot will read XML documentation generated by MSBuild\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe implementation adds a managed callback from ScriptManagerBridge to collect XML documentation summaries, store them in CSharpScript and exposes them through `get_documentation()` / `get_doc_class_name()`. `CSharpLanguage::supports_documentation()` now returns true, so the summaries flow through the existing documentation pipeline (EditorFileSystem registration, Inspector tooltips, Script Editor help) - the same path GDScript uses, with no changes to editor_inspector.cpp or editor_help.cpp. It enables docs generation by default with opt-out through `GodotGenerateXmlDoc=false`, supresses `CS1591` warning to avoid warnings about incomplete XML comments, adds `XmlDocumentationCache` which lazily reads and caches the generated .xml file next to the assembly, invalidates cached documentation when the XML file write time changes, uses weak assembly-keyed caching to avoid pinning collectible load contexts during reloads, supports class and field/property summaries, only [Tool] classes, and only their exported members, falls back to unchanged behavior if documentation is missing, invalid or cannot be loaded.\r\n\r\n**This was developed against Godot 4.6.3 as internal company's R&D engine mod. With the consent of the management board it is being published now so someone can finish this and rebase into master.**\r\n\r\nNote: this PR is currently opened from a 4.6.3 tag and includes unrelated 4.6.x history. The actual intended change is 2b664cf.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"